"Android needs memory it can write and then run, which on iOS only an attached debugger can grant. Choose how your %@ gets one." = "Android 需要可寫入後再執行的記憶體，而在 iOS 上只有連接著的偵錯程式能授予。請選擇你的 %@ 要如何取得偵錯程式。";
"Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card on QEMU's own network. Nothing on your phone's network can see the guest, and the guest cannot see it." = "Android 透過 QEMU 自有網路上的虛擬乙太網路卡連上網際網路。你手機網路上的任何裝置都看不到客體，客體也看不到它們。";
"Android runs fully emulated, so it is slower than games on the translation layer. Use it for apps Husk cannot run directly, like Termux or app stores." = "Android 以完整模擬方式執行，因此比轉譯層上的遊戲慢。請用它來執行 Husk 無法直接執行的應用，例如 Termux 或應用商店。";
