"The game starts with nothing over it: no bar, no controller, no readout. Tap with three fingers at once to bring the bar back, and again to hide it. The Hide button in the bar does the same while playing." = "遊戲啟動時畫面上方什麼都沒有：沒有工具列、控制器或讀數。三指同時點按可把工具列叫回來，再點一次可隱藏。工具列中的「隱藏」按鈕在遊玩時也有相同作用。";
