"The pairing file stays in Husk's Documents folder and is only sent to Husk's own helper." = "配對檔案儲存在 Husk 的「文件」資料夾中，只會傳送給 Husk 自己的輔助工具。";
"The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs one cold boot, and the next save replaces the machine saved at the old size — changing back costs another. Sizes are rounded to a multiple of eight. Bigger is slower: every pixel is drawn by an emulated phone. Android's density does not change with the panel, so a larger one shows more rather than bigger." = "面板在機器啟動時建立，所以變更需付出一次冷啟動，下次儲存會取代以舊尺寸儲存的機器——改回去又要再付出一次。尺寸會四捨五入到 8 的倍數。越大越慢：每個像素都由模擬的手機繪製。Android 的密度不會隨面板改變，所以較大的面板顯示更多內容，而不是把內容放大。";
"The plan, in order, is docs/04-translation-layer.md in Husk's source." = "計劃的先後順序見 Husk 原始碼中的 docs/04-translation-layer.md。";
"The report holds the full log of that run and which device and build it was on. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you share it." = "報告包含那次執行的完整日誌，以及所用的裝置和版本。除非你分享，否則不會傳送到任何地方。";
